{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2021-10-08 06:30:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE AND ONE CLICK LCA COLLABORATE TO PROVIDE EMBODIED CARBON CALCULATIONS FOR DIFFERENT PHASES OF CONSTRUCTION PROJECTS', 'text': "SUNNYVALE, CALIF. AND HELSINKI, OCT. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A COLLABORATION WITH ONE CLICK LCA THAT ENABLES USERS OF TRIMBLE'S TEKLA BUILDING INFORMATION MODELING (BIM)\xa0SOFTWARE TO CALCULATE CARBON EMISSIONS AT DIFFERENT PHASES OF A PROJECT, HELPING TO MOVE THE NEEDLE TOWARD A NET ZERO FUTURE FOR CONSTRUCTION."}